<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>LATE REPORTED SALES FOR OCTOBER</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS</p>
<p>Lily - (built 1966) 12,585 dwt sold for $169.50 plt for delivery India.</p>
<p>RO-RO VESSEL</p>
<p>Ponce - (built 1968) 18,725 dwt sold for $117 plt as is where is Orange, Texas.</p>
</text>
